oracle GNU Make 4.4.1
outcome success
file Makefile kept 8
| # A `define` body's continuations answer to `.POSIX:` too, including one the
| # evaluation reaches: the body was read whole before the eval ran.
| $(eval .POSIX:)
| define A
| a   \
|   b
| endef
| all: ; @printf '[%s]\n' '$(A)' > out
file out touched 1
| [a    b]
